          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p></p><p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> 1/11/2025<br/></p><p><strong>Overview</strong></p><p>We want you to love your Imperial Knots rug. However, if your purchase does not meet your expectations, you may be eligible to return or exchange it according to the guidelines below. Please read carefully before placing an order.</p><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Return Eligibility</strong></p><ul><li>Return requests must be submitted <strong>within 2 days of delivery</strong>.</li><li>Rugs must be in <strong>original condition</strong>, which means:</li><li><strong>Not used or placed on the floor</strong></li><li><strong>Not cleaned, washed, or altered</strong></li><li>Free from <strong>stains, odors, dust, marks, or pet hair</strong></li><li>All <strong>tags, labels, packaging, and serial numbers</strong> intact</li><li><strong>All Returns are subject to a 10% restocking fee</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Any use or damage voids eligibility for return.</strong><br/><strong>We reserve the right to deny returns that do not meet these conditions.</strong></p><p><strong>Non-Returnable Items</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Custom & Made-to-Order rugs</strong></li><li>Rugs purchased under <strong>sale, promotion, or clearance events</strong></li><li>Rugs that fail quality inspection upon return</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Exchange Policy</strong></p><ul><li>Exchange requests may be made <strong>within 5 days of delivery</strong>.</li><li>Exchange is processed <strong>only after Quality Control approval</strong>.</li><li>Exchanges are allowed for <strong>equal or higher-value items</strong> (price difference applies).</li></ul><p><strong>Custom Orders</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Cannot be canceled after confirmation</strong></li><li><strong>No returns allowed</strong></li><li><strong>Exchange only in case of a verified manufacturing defect</strong></li></ul><p></p><p></p><p><strong>How to Raise a Return or Exchange Request</strong></p><p>Email <strong>info@imperialknots.com</strong> with:</p><ol><li>Order Number</li><li>Reason for return or exchange</li><li>Clear photos of the rug and packaging</li><li>If defective: detailed photos highlighting the issue</li></ol><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Pickup & Shipping</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Free return pickup within India only.</strong></li><li>Customers <strong>must pack the rug in original packaging OR roll it securely with bubble wrap + tape</strong></li><li>If the rug is <strong>damaged in transit because of improper packing</strong>, QC will <strong>reject</strong> the return</li><li><strong>No refund or exchange</strong> will be applicable in such cases.</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Quality Control Inspection</strong></p><p>Once we receive the returned item, it goes through <strong>Quality Control</strong>:</p><p><strong>QC Result</strong></p><p><strong>Outcome</strong></p><p><strong>Approved</strong></p><p>Refund or Exchange is processed</p><p><strong>Rejected</strong> (rug used, altered, soiled, or damaged)</p><p>Rug is returned to you <strong>at your cost</strong> with <strong>no refund or exchange</strong></p><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Refund Policy</strong></p><ul><li>Refunds are initiated <strong>within 5–7 working days</strong> after QC approval.</li><li>Refunds are issued to the <strong>original payment method</strong> or <strong>store credit</strong>.</li><li>Shipping charges (if applicable) are <strong>non-refundable</strong>.</li></ul><p><strong>International Orders</strong></p><ul><li>Customers must <strong>arrange and pay</strong> for return shipping.</li><li>Imperial Knots is <strong>not liable</strong> for damage during international transit.</li><li>If the rug arrives damaged internationally, we will assist in filing a <strong>claim with the carrier</strong>.</li><li>Refunds are issued in the <strong>original payment currency</strong>.</li><li><strong>Bank fees, currency conversion losses, or foreign exchange differences are the customer’s responsibility.</strong></li><li><strong>No refunds via bank transfer</strong> for international orders.</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Order Cancellation</strong></p><ul><li>Orders canceled <strong>within 24 hours</strong> may be accepted.</li><li><strong>Orders canceled after 24 hours are subject to a 10% restocking fee.</strong></li><li>Orders <strong>cannot be canceled once shipped</strong>.</li></ul><p>Imperial Knots may also cancel orders at its sole discretion in cases of:</p><ul><li>Pricing errors</li><li>Stock unavailability</li><li>Policy non-compliance</li><li>Suspected fraud</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Fraud & Chargeback Policy</strong></p><ul><li>All payments are secured via verified payment gateways.</li><li>Unauthorized or wrongful chargebacks may result in:</li><li><strong>Permanent account ban</strong></li><li><strong>Legal recovery of funds</strong></li><li>If suspicious activity is detected, Imperial Knots may:</li><li>Hold shipments pending verification</li><li>Request identity/payment proof for high-value orders</li><li>Report fraudulent activity to authorities</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p><strong>GST & Invoicing</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Digital invoices</strong> are emailed once your order ships.</li><li>Business buyers requiring <strong>GST Input Credit (ITC)</strong> must provide <strong>GSTIN at checkout</strong>.</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Gift Cards & Store Credit</strong></p><ul><li>Gift cards are <strong>digital</strong> and valid for <strong>12 months</strong> from the issue date.</li><li>Store credits <strong>cannot be converted to cash</strong>.</li><li>Lost or stolen gift cards <strong>cannot be replaced or transferred.</strong></li></ul><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Liability Disclaimer</strong></p><ul><li>Imperial Knots is responsible for the rug <strong>until successful delivery</strong>.</li><li>After delivery, we are <strong>not liable</strong> for:</li><li>Misuse</li><li>Incorrect cleaning</li><li>Storage damage</li><li>Wear and tear</li><li>Rugs damaged, soiled, or altered after delivery are <strong>not eligible</strong> for return or exchange.</li><li>We may request additional proof if a return claim appears inconsistent or fraudulent.</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Contact Us</strong></p><p>For return or exchange assistance:<br/><strong>Email:</strong> info@imperialknots.com<br/><strong>Business Name:</strong> Imperial Mastercrafts</p>"
          }
